/* BMeet.app in Russian. The key is the English text as macos/Sources/BMeet has it in L("…");
   keep %@ and %d in the translation (%1$@, %2$@ to change their order). macos/tools/
   check-strings.py checks this file against the source, in CI.

   The words are the ones the BMeet window uses too (docs/macos.md): диктовка, встреча,
   онлайн-встреча, очная встреча, расшифровка, собеседники, сочетание клавиш, настройки. No «ё».
   What goes into transcript files stays English (You, Remote, Person 1), and so do the names
   BMeet, Whisper, GigaAM and Neural Engine. */

